{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":202074,\"title\":\"Daniel & Nicolette\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Nicole wants to stand on stage as a DJ, become a musician so famous that she can catch up with her boyfriend, Stevan, in Paris. For the sake of his dream, he is determined to do everything including becoming a personal assistant to Daniel, the owner of a hotel and restaurant from the Maestro group while continuing to strive to realize his dream.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yvqJPyIOyGFshLHkSnzLbkMVuYF.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/A1w91S9XWLEGojAb0xYMGKoap7n.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"year\":2022,\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"status\":\"Ended\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":1,\"totalEpisodes\":8,\"createdBy\":[],\"networks\":[],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"ID\",\"name\":\"Indonesia\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2022-06-19\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1766171,\"name\":\"Surya Ardy Octaviand\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1cCV26LD5FBjmSyjWkCZWSFnvMh.jpg\"},{\"id\":1258954,\"name\":\"Cinta Laura Kiehl\",\"character\":\"Nicolette\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tqIPriX1RITfZc52GmAmlrVKoiL.jpg\"},{\"id\":2367270,\"name\":\"Jerome Kurnia\",\"character\":\"Daniel\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hzchWa08VOskhbHIDJwMJFAtXek.jpg\"},{\"id\":2046541,\"name\":\"Jihane Almira\",\"character\":\"Miranda\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7Fm3sQGUXS0vL6aekCa4i7TpZqx.jpg\"},{\"id\":2126761,\"name\":\"Susan Sameh\",\"character\":\"Livia Diandra\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nFsdCPS6nisVH12yVUYXFl85RGB.jpg\"},{\"id\":2017873,\"name\":\"Wafda Saifan\",\"character\":\"Stevan Harris\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/o404ufcRUT3lshHhZceCC4JQl3.jpg\"},{\"id\":3109530,\"name\":\"Dito Darmawan\",\"character\":\"Hadyanta Anggarabudi\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/p9OKKLFP7q9wX3ZBMhB9oKxXbw1.jpg\"},{\"id\":1773691,\"name\":\"Refal Hady\",\"character\":\"Sean Martadinata\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5EzHYzTCCrSI6eflhjKYc7mNl4k.jpg\"},{\"id\":5476025,\"name\":\"Bobby Eress\",\"character\":\"Wirawan Wiraatmaja\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1766163,\"name\":\"DJ Yasmin\",\"character\":\"DJ Fay\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ygEoq27xwe9yLLHcCJG4RGATWNR.jpg\"},{\"id\":6610789,\"name\":\"Anneke Gruno\",\"character\":\"Galuh\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/j0nAIVo55CnVDznX6UpUQMdrQa2.jpg\"}],\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"aNnij16fe-0\",\"name\":\"Trailer Resmi | Daniel & Nicolette | Cinta Laura, Susan Sameh, Jihane Almira, Jerome Kurnia\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"similar\":[],\"seasonNumber\":1,\"seasonName\":\"Season 1\",\"seasonOverview\":\"\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/40jcIe50vUqPH61tGxwAr4mNYz2.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2022-05-15\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Shocking Intro\",\"overview\":\"Nicole has a dream to become a famous DJ and follows her boyfriend, Stevan, to Paris. However, stage fright and her phobia of germs continue to be difficult for her to overcome. It made her give up and feel enough about her job as a karaoke place employee. One day, fate brought Nicole together with Daniel, a famous music producer who might be able to help Nicole achieve her dream.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-05-15\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Beat Juggling\",\"overview\":\"Nicole becomes Daniel's personal assistant under a fake name. Her first day on the job as an assistant wasn't all that fun, especially since Daniel's girlfriend Miranda started looking for Nicole. The two of them meet, but it turns out that Miranda and Nicole have a relationship that Daniel did not expect.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-05-15\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Needle Drop\",\"overview\":\"Miranda revealed that Nicole had been using a fake name all this time. Daniel was surprised. Miranda begins to recall bad childhood memories of Nicole, then vents her hatred and tries to get Nicole fired. On the other hand, an opportunity came to Nicole, but it might complicate things.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-05-15\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Old Song Remix\",\"overview\":\"The past of Nicole, who had worked at a karaoke place as an entertainer, was revealed by Miranda. Nicole accuses Livia of leaking her work information to Miranda, the two of them get into a fight and Nicole is kicked out of Livia's apartment. Nicole's friendship with Livia is threatened with ruin when Miranda begins to make a tempting offer to Livia.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-05-29\",\"runtime\":47},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Melodic Beat\",\"overview\":\"After Nicole stays at Daniel's house, their relationship gets more intimate. Daniel also invites Nicole to date. Nicole's feelings became depressed when Stevan announced that he was going back to Jakarta. On the other hand, Daniel offered Nicole to be the DJ on New Year's Eve, making everyone shaken by the news.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-05-29\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Mix Tape\",\"overview\":\"A video circulates Nicole arguing with DJ Fay, creating an uncomfortable situation for Daniel. Miranda advises Daniel to fire Nicole for defaming the Maestro Group. However, Daniel refused and decided to resign from the Maestro Group. Nicole and Daniel started from scratch and tried to rise from adversity.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-06-05\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"The Music Is Off\",\"overview\":\"Livia strives to establish a good relationship with Yasmin, while continuing to pursue a career that looks increasingly promising. On the other hand, Daniel proposes to Nicole and takes everyone by surprise. Nicole accepted the proposal, but there was a feeling of uneasiness in her heart. The feeling of desperation was made worse when Nicole was told that Daniel was doing something fraudulent.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-06-12\",\"runtime\":51},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Synchronization\",\"overview\":\"Nicole leaves for Paris to find Stefan. There Nicole was reunited by her former lover who accepted her with a smile. Daniel leaves for Paris to meet Nicole and explain the situation. Nicole is caught between two men, Daniel and Stevan, her present and past.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-06-19\",\"runtime\":47}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2022-05-15\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}